subckt mq_cdac_assist_pulse (PHI_S PHI_SB AGATE DVDD VREFN VSS)
// MOS gate loads delay a PHI_S inverter; two inverters restore the delayed control.
// The pass TG first passes PHI_SB to AGATE, then a PMOS pulls AGATE to DVDD.
// The pulse duration and overlap require PVT, startup and full-circuit verification.
M0N (D0 PHI_S VREFN VSS) nch_ulvt_mac w=4e-07 l=3e-08 nf=1
M0P (D0 PHI_S DVDD DVDD) pch_mac w=8e-07 l=3e-08 nf=1
MLOAD0 (VREFN D0 VREFN VSS) nch_ulvt_mac w=2.4e-05 l=3e-08 nf=12
MLOAD1 (VREFN D0 VREFN VSS) nch_ulvt_mac w=2.4e-05 l=3e-08 nf=12
MLOAD2 (VREFN D0 VREFN VSS) nch_ulvt_mac w=2.4e-05 l=3e-08 nf=12
MLOAD3 (VREFN D0 VREFN VSS) nch_ulvt_mac w=2.4e-05 l=3e-08 nf=12
M1N (D1 D0 VREFN VSS) nch_ulvt_mac w=2e-06 l=3e-08 nf=1
M1P (D1 D0 DVDD DVDD) pch_ulvt_mac w=4e-06 l=3e-08 nf=2
M2N (D2 D1 VREFN VSS) nch_ulvt_mac w=4e-06 l=3e-08 nf=2
M2P (D2 D1 DVDD DVDD) pch_mac w=8e-06 l=3e-08 nf=4
MNPASS (AGATE D2 PHI_SB VSS) nch_ulvt_mac w=4e-06 l=3e-08 nf=2
MPPASS (AGATE D1 PHI_SB DVDD) pch_mac w=8e-06 l=3e-08 nf=4
MPUP (AGATE D2 DVDD DVDD) pch_mac w=8e-06 l=3e-08 nf=4
