XAPULSE (PHI_S PHI_SB APGATE DVDD VREFN VSS) mq_cdac_assist_pulse
XSW12 (VIN VG DH12 RL12 EN ENB VREFP VREFN VSS DVDD EQBUS APGATE BPH12 BPL12) mq_cdac_sw12
